From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Faboit1 <omarassayed3@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:54:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Visibility Anticheat

Native, server-side visibility protections: ray traced anti-xray, anti-ESP,
anti-freecam, underground view distance and related leak filters. The logic
lives in io.canvasmc.canvas.anticheat, this patch wires it into the chunk
sending, entity tracking and block broadcasting code paths.

